# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.pnpm-store/

# Datasets: the measured data (dataset.json + design.md) is committed and
# shareable; screenshots are NOT (size + third-party site copyright) —
# regenerate them locally with the dataset-builder agent if you want them.
/data/datasets/**/*.png
/data/datasets/**/*.jpg
/data/datasets/**/*.webp

